+# Production Hardening Checklist (Inference, Security, Retrieval, Monitoring)
+
+1. Inference
+ - Deploy vLLM nodes with GPU requests/limits and configure HPA or cluster autoscaler for GPU.
+ - Use async_batched_inference_server.py and tune BATCH_MAX_SIZE & BATCH_TIMEOUT_SEC.
+ - Run throughput tests (./.github/workflows/throughput_test.yml) in staging and benchmark memory/latency.
+
+2. Security & mTLS
+ - Install Vault CSI provider; apply SecretProviderClass; run ops/vault/rotate_and_annotate.py for cert rotation.
+ - Ensure PRODUCTION env var is set on clients and services to enforce secure channels.
+
+3. Agents & LangChain
+ - Enable RateLimitInterceptor and AuthInterceptor in gRPC servers; configure token validator (OIDC/JWKS).
+ - Persist conversation history (Chroma) and snapshot regularly to S3.
+
+4. Formal & Audit
+ - Run model_code_traceability.py and assign unmapped actions to engineers.
+ - Package Apalache/TLC runs + signed artifacts for auditors.
+
+5. Monitoring
+ - Deploy Prometheus & Grafana with dashboards in ops/observability/*
+ - Export per-request energy/tokens metrics and set alerts for drift and MTTR increases.
